false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"任务开始位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/13/1694811/d7495ae8ab3d8706e29f8d4d34e29179_7568281928065894793.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1371","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e〓路线攻略〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e具体路线攻略推荐：\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/article/25508670\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e【V2.8攻略】#邀约事件#鹿野院平藏邀约第一幕分支及成就\u003c/a\u003e  作者：\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003eFTFuture\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd1 不蒸发的回忆\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/13/1694811/e1d67cbb1deb17217a6672b485acd9d6_4874199811501203360.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e一段旅途总会结束，但回忆不会。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 「天上掉下个鬼兜虫」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/13/1694811/b49def0289801b8a2571b6d586cc3587_8752510335530361769.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「天上会掉鬼兜吗？还是什么也不会掉呢？」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 绝不被骗三人组\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/13/1694811/87432dcb21973ea30dee9a1bdfe2ed58_999380118896913691.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「我们中有一个人被骗了，不是我。」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「也不是我。」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「总不会是本大爷吧？一定是最笨的飞行矮堇瓜！哈哈哈哈哈！」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; 